# move-lines-before — шаги записи (что показывается — move-lines-before.md)
# «До»: встроенный перенос строки Obsidian, без плагина в деле. Один этап, настроек нет.
title Without the plugin: Move line up | Obsidian moves one line per press: sub-items stay behind and the list falls apart
open Weekly plan.md
caret 2. Pay the rent
# Фон строки — только здесь: GIF про то, что поехало вместе со строкой.
mark line
say Obsidian's Move line up moves just this one line
cmd editor:swap-line-up
expect 1. Call the bank /     1. ask about the card / 2. Pay the rent /     1. check the rate /     2. transfer
say It climbs into the neighbor's sub-items
cmd editor:swap-line-up
expect 1. Call the bank / 2. Pay the rent /     1. ask about the card /     2. check the rate
say Its own sub-items stayed behind: the list is broken
cmd editor:swap-line-up
expect 1. Pay the rent / 2. Call the bank /     1. ask about the card /     2. check the rate /     3. transfer /     4. receipt / 3. Buy groceries
say With inlineOverhaul the whole item moves together
pause 2600
